    Bug 1953353 - Make the used IMAP extensions in xpcshell tests configurable and wait for folder event when creating messages. r=mkmelin

    This follows suite what we do in browser tests already.

    Ultimativly, browser tests and xpcshell test should use the same
    functions for basic account operations. We will get to it when adding
    support and tests for EWS accounts.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D241151

